{
  "name": "Villa Review Automation",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Villa Review Automation\n\n**What it does:** pulls latest Google reviews, drafts a warm reply to each (happy or unhappy tone), logs them to a sheet marked 'Pending Approval', and writes an owner insight brief.\n\n**IMPORTANT:** replies are DRAFTS saved to the sheet for the owner to review and post manually. It does NOT auto-post to Google. That's intentional — a human should approve public replies.\n\n**Before running, edit:**\n1. Apify node -> your Apify token + [VILLA_NAME], [LOCATION]\n2. Both reply-draft nodes -> replace [VILLA_NAME], [LOCATION]\n3. Insight node -> nothing to edit\n4. Both Google Sheets nodes -> your Sheet ID + reconnect Google credential (needs a 'Reviews' tab and an 'Insights' tab)\n5. All OpenAI nodes -> reconnect your OpenAI credential\n6. To automate daily: swap the manual trigger for a Schedule Trigger (e.g. every morning 8 AM)\n7. Per new client: duplicate this whole workflow, repeat steps 1-4 for their villa/sheet",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1408,
        320
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "3535c28f-751d-4684-85bf-b80d1b3aff20",
      "name": "Setup Notes"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/compass~crawler-google-places/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "Bearer PUT_YOUR_TOKEN_HERE"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ {\n  \"searchStringsArray\": [\"[VILLA_NAME], [LOCATION]\"],\n  \"maxCrawledPlacesPerSearch\": 1,\n  \"maxReviews\": 15,\n  \"reviewsSort\": \"newest\",\n  \"language\": \"en\"\n} }}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "7a852768-9d70-4722-922d-763fe7ce6814",
      "name": "Get Google Reviews (Apify)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        160,
        288
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const out = [];\nfor (const item of $input.all()) {\n  const p = item.json;\n  const reviews = Array.isArray(p.reviews) ? p.reviews : ((p.text || p.stars) ? [p] : []);\n  for (const r of reviews) {\n    out.push({ json: {\n      reviewer: r.name || r.reviewerName || 'A guest',\n      text: r.text || r.textTranslated || '(rating only, no written review)',\n      rating: Number(r.stars ?? r.rating ?? 0),\n      date: r.publishedAtDate || r.publishAt || '',\n      url: r.reviewUrl || r.url || ''\n    }});\n  }\n}\nreturn out;"
      },
      "id": "579fb33b-51d4-44ef-904c-4d21f010d341",
      "name": "Flatten & Normalize Reviews",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        352,
        288
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "rv-cond-happy",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.rating }}",
              "rightValue": 4,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
