        "jsonBody": "={{ { \"model\":\"gpt-4o-mini\", \"temperature\":0.4, \"messages\":[ {\"role\":\"system\",\"content\":\"You are a hospitality business analyst for a boutique villa. Read ALL these Google reviews together and give the owner a short, punchy insight brief. Output exactly: 2-3 bullet points on recurring THEMES (what guests repeatedly praise or complain about, with rough counts like '4 of 15'), then a final line starting 'RECOMMENDED ACTION:' naming the single most valuable fix or improvement. Be specific and concrete — mention things like cleanliness, food, staff, check-in experience, amenities, value. No fluff, no preamble.\"}, {\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":$json.digest} ] } }}",
